 "body_html": "<h2>Cómo se hace</h2><p>El <b>límite</b> de f en a es el valor al que se acerca f(x) cuando x se acerca a a. Si los límites laterales no coinciden, no existe.</p><p>En el infinito, en un cociente de polinomios mandan los términos de mayor grado.</p><p><b>Indeterminaciones</b>: 0/0 (se factoriza y simplifica), ∞/∞ (se comparan grados), ∞ − ∞ (conjugado), 1<sup>∞</sup> (número e) y la regla de L'Hôpital.</p><p>f es <b>continua</b> en a si existe f(a), existe el límite y coinciden.</p><div class='qfig'><svg data-pf='lg' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 330 280' width='330' height='280' role='img' aria-label='función con asíntotas x = 1 e y = 2'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><line x1='34.0' y1='252.0' x2='34.0' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='34.0' y='183.7' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−5</text><line x1='57.8' y1='252.0' x2='57.8' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='57.8' y='183.7' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−4</text><line x1='81.6' y1='252.0' x2='81.6' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='81.6' y='183.7' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−3</text><line x1='105.5' y1='252.0' x2='105.5' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='105.5' y='183.7' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−2</text><line x1='129.3' y1='252.0' x2='129.3' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='129.3' y='183.7' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>−1</text><line x1='153.1' y1='252.0' x2='153.1' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='176.9' y1='252.0' x2='176.9' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='176.9' y='183.7' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>1</text><line x1='200.7' y1='252.0' x2='200.7' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke